# API Rules

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) §10.

- Global prefix: `/api/v1` — MM: `/api/v1/mm/*`.
- Before new routes: grep controllers and frontend `*Service.ts` for existing endpoints.
- One canonical operation per use case (avoid parallel list/search/foo endpoints).
- Validate: auth, authorization, org scope, DTO class-validator, state transitions, idempotency keys where posting.
- Errors: use Nest HTTP exceptions; do not return 200 on partial failure unless API contract says so.
- Frontend services mirror backend paths; keep types in module `types/`.

Canonical examples: [docs/CANONICAL_PATTERNS.md](../../docs/CANONICAL_PATTERNS.md).
